frontend technologies
static webpage- content is fixed
1) html - structure--git 
2) css - stylings --- bootstrap 
dynamic webpage- where user can interact 
3) javascript
4) react- framework



HTML - Hypertext markup language
hypertext - a text referred to another text 
markup - a set of rules that defines how content
should be displayed on the browser


it is a standard markup language that is used to 
create structure for a webpages
it contains series of elements that are represented by tags

tag
<resword>  open tag
</resword>  closing tag

element
open tag + content + closing tag
<resword>some content </resword>

heading tags
<h1>Heading</h1>  - 32px
<h2>content</h2>
<h6>smallest heading</h6>



extensions
1) live server
2) live preview 
3) prettier
4) es 7+ react



Basic structure of html
declaration-it tells the type and version(5) of document
<!DOCTYPE html>
html is a root element of the document
<html>
    it contains title,metadata and third party links
    <head>
        <title>first wepage</title>
    </head>
    it contains all webpage content
    <body>
      <h1>my first web page</h1>
    </body>
</html>

